# Auto detect text files and perform LF normalization
* text=auto

# Pictures and other binary files are stored in ordinary git: none of the Godot project's files is
# near GitHub's 100 MB limit. (The unity branch still keeps its large files in Git LFS.) The baked
# terrain packs are far too big for git and are shared as a GitHub release instead; see
# tns-godot/README.md, "Running".
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.tif binary
*.zip binary
